var _markdown = "\n\n`CFont.h`\n\n游戏内置字。画在 `drawingEvent`。更省事可用 [gamefont 扩展](/docs/plugins/extensions/font)。\n\n## 缩放与颜色 [#缩放与颜色]\n\n<Api name=\"SetScale / SetColor / SetAlphaFade\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static void SetScale(float w, float h);\n      static void SetColor(CRGBA color);\n      static void SetAlphaFade(float alpha);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      CFont::SetScale(0.5f, 1.0f);\n      CFont::SetColor(CRGBA(255, 255, 255, 255));\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 字体样式与对齐 [#字体样式与对齐]\n\n<Api name=\"SetFontStyle / SetOrientation / SetJustify\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static void SetFontStyle(short style);\n      static void SetOrientation(eFontAlignment alignment);\n      static void SetJustify(bool on);\n      static void SetCentreSize(float value);\n      static void SetWrapx(float value);\n      static void SetProportional(bool on);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      // CFont::SetFontStyle(1);\n      // CFont::SetOrientation(ALIGN_CENTER); // 以枚举为准\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 阴影与描边 [#阴影与描边]\n\n<Api name=\"SetDropColor / SetDropShadowPosition / SetEdge\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static void SetDropColor(CRGBA color);\n      static void SetDropShadowPosition(short value);\n      static void SetEdge(short value);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      CFont::SetDropShadowPosition(1);\n      CFont::SetDropColor(CRGBA(0, 0, 0, 255));\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 背景 [#背景]\n\n<Api name=\"SetBackground / SetBackgroundColor\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static void SetBackground(bool enable, bool includeWrap);\n      static void SetBackgroundColor(CRGBA color);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      CFont::SetBackground(true, false);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 打印字符串 [#打印字符串]\n\n<Api name=\"PrintString / PrintStringFromBottom\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static void PrintString(float x, float y, const char* text);\n      static void PrintStringFromBottom(float x, float y, const char* text);\n      static void PrintChar(float x, float y, char character);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      plugin::Events::drawingEvent += [] {\n          CFont::SetScale(0.4f, 0.8f);\n          CFont::SetColor(CRGBA(255, 255, 255, 255));\n          CFont::PrintString(50.0f, 50.0f, \"hello\");\n      };\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 测宽与矩形 [#测宽与矩形]\n\n<Api name=\"GetStringWidth / GetTextRect\">\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"签名\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"签名\">\n        签名\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"示例\">\n        示例\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"签名\">\n      ```cpp\n      static float GetStringWidth(const char* string, bool spaces, bool scriptValues = false);\n      static void GetTextRect(CRect* rect, float x, float y, const char* text);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"示例\">\n      ```cpp\n      float w = CFont::GetStringWidth(\"hello\", true);\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Api>\n\n## 缓冲 [#缓冲]\n\n<Api name=\"InitPerFrame / RenderFontBuffer\">\n  一般引擎已调；自管缓冲时才碰。\n\n  ```cpp\n  static void InitPerFrame();\n  static void RenderFontBuffer();\n  static void DrawFonts();\n  ```\n</Api>\n\n屏幕坐标用 [Screen](/docs/plugins/extensions/screen)。\n";
